Exercise 6: Create, Switch, and Delete a Branch
AIM: To create, switch between, and delete branches in Git.
ALGORITHM
STEP 1: Open a terminal.
STEP 2: Navigate to the Git repository.
STEP 3: Display the existing branches using git branch.
STEP 4: Create a new branch using git branch.
STEP 5: Switch to the new branch using git switch.
STEP 6: Verify the current branch.
STEP 7: Switch back to the main branch.
STEP 8: Delete the new branch after switching away from it.
STEP 9: End the terminal.
TERMINAL RUN CODE
cd git-practical
git branch
git branch feature-demo
git switch feature-demo
git branch
git switch main
git branch -d feature-demo
git branch
OUTPUT

